(4178, '', 'Bạn có ổn không?', 1, 3860, 6523, '', 1, 1, '', '', 'This question is another way to ask, “How are you managing this difficult situation?” And, many people use it to check in on their loved ones, especially during hardships like divorce, illness, or job loss. It’s a meaningful way to show empathy because it lets the other person know they’re heard and supported.', ''),
